   "sid": "s1",
   "date": "2025-07-23",
   "url": "https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2025/07/white-house-unveils-americas-ai-action-plan/",
   "text": "Winning the AI Race is non-negotiable. America must continue to be the dominant force in artificial intelligence to promote prosperity and protect our economic and national security.",
